  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Private Paradise on Front Beach Road, a stunning six-bedroom, four-bathroom vacation home just steps from the private, gated access to the low-density beach of Panama City Beach, Florida. This luxurious Snowbird and pet-friendly retreat combines elegance, comfort, and convenience, making it the perfect choice for your next getaway.<br><br>Step inside and be greeted by an inviting space filled with natural light and thoughtful architectural details. The spacious primary suite is a true oasis, featuring a spa-inspired bathroom with a Jacuzzi soaking tub and a glass-enclosed shower. Five additional bedrooms ensure plenty of space for the whole group, while the home comfortably accommodates up to 16 guests with a bunk bed and two sofa beds in the common areas.<br><br>The chef’s kitchen is a dream for cooking and entertaining, complete with top-of-the-line appliances, a double gas oven and stove, and two refrigerators. Outside, your private backyard oasis awaits. Take a dip in the heated pool (additional $100 per night, 2 night minimum) , or lounge on the sun-soaked deck in the fully fenced backyard. Fire up one of the two grills for a delicious cookout, challenge your group to a game of cornhole, or practice your swing on the putting green, all while surrounded by beautifully landscaped grounds.<br><br>In addition to its prime location across from the beach, this retreat is conveniently close to 30A, Rosemary Beach, Inlet Beach, and Carillon Beach. Nearby attractions also include Powell Lake Park and Camp Helen State Park, offering endless opportunities for exploration and relaxation.<br><br>With stunning Gulf views from the upper deck and an unbeatable location right across from the beach, Private Paradise on Front Beach Road is designed to deliver unforgettable moments. Book your stay today and create memories that will last a lifetime!<br><br>Clean Coverlet Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.<br><br>*Please note: this property has an exterior security camera on the front of the garage facing the front yard.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
